---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant DB as Vigilo DB

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo run export
    activate Vigilo

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Validate export request
    Vigilo->>DB: Load run
    DB-->>Vigilo: Run record
    Vigilo->>DB: Load results summary
    DB-->>Vigilo: Summary counts and scores

    alt JSON export
        loop Execution batches
            Vigilo->>DB: Load executions and related records
            DB-->>Vigilo: Batch data
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Accumulate export data
        end
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Build export payload
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    else JSONL export
        Vigilo-->>User: Run line
        Vigilo-->>User: Summary line
        loop Execution batches
            Vigilo->>DB: Load executions and related records
            DB-->>Vigilo: Batch data
            Vigilo-->>User: Execution, aggregate, attempt, and result lines
        end
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    else Validation or lookup fails
        Vigilo-->>User: Export error
    end

    deactivate Vigilo
